age 2026-10-02; gemini-2.5-pro, -2.5-flash and -2.5-flash-lite 2026-10-16; the gpt-5 and o3 dated snapshots 2026-12-11; gemini-3.1-flash-lite 2027-05-07. Moonshot Kimi K3 (1M context, single tier) and MiniMax M3/M2.7 are sourced from kimi.com/resources/kimi-k3-pricing and platform.minimax.io/docs/guides/pricing-paygo.",
